"px-4 py-2.5 text-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"mx-auto text-pos\"><path d=\"M232.49,80.49l-128,128a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-56-56a12,12,0,1,1,17-17L96,183,215.51,63.51a12,12,0,0,1,17,17Z\"></path></svg></td><td class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"mx-auto text-pos\"><path d=\"M232.49,80.49l-128,128a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-56-56a12,12,0,1,1,17-17L96,183,215.51,63.51a12,12,0,0,1,17,17Z\"></path></svg></td></tr><tr><td class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-ink-2\">PDF export &amp; shareable link</td><td class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"mx-auto text-ink-3\"><path d=\"M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H216A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z\"></path></svg></td><td class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"mx-auto text-pos\"><path d=\"M232.49,80.49l-128,128a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-56-56a12,12,0,1,1,17-17L96,183,215.51,63.51a12,12,0,0,1,17,17Z\"></path></svg></td><td class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"mx-auto text-pos\"><path d=\"M232.49,80.49l-128,128a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-56-56a12,12,0,1,1,17-17L96,183,215.51,63.51a12,12,0,0,1,17,17Z\"></path></svg></td></tr><tr><td class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-ink-2\">Weekly re-audits &amp; trend lines</td><td class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"mx-auto text-ink-3\"><path d=\"M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H216A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z\"></path></svg></td><td class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"mx-auto text-ink-3\"><path d=\"M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H216A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z\"></path></svg></td><td class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"mx-auto text-pos\"><path d=\"M232.49,80.49l-128,128a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-56-56a12,12,0,1,1,17-17L96,183,215.51,63.51a12,12,0,0,1,17,17Z\"></path></svg></td></tr><tr><td class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-ink-2\">Competitor-overtake alerts</td><td class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"mx-auto text-ink-3\"><path d=\"M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H216A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z\"></path></svg></td><td class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"mx-auto text-ink-3\"><path d=\"M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H216A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z\"></path></svg></td><td class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"mx-auto text-pos\"><path d=\"M232.49,80.49l-128,128a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-56-56a12,12,0,1,1,17-17L96,183,215.51,63.51a12,12,0,0,1,17,17Z\"></path></svg></td></tr><tr><td class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-ink-2\">Domains</td><td class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-center\"><span class=\"data-fig text-sm text-ink\">1</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-center\"><span class=\"data-fig text-sm text-ink\">1</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-center\"><span class=\"data-fig text-sm text-ink\">3</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class=\"site-container py-16 sm:py-20\"><header class=\"max-w-2xl scroll-mt-24 \"><p class=\"eyebrow mb-3\">FAQ</p><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-3xl\">Questions about pricing and the product</h2></header><div class=\"mx-auto mt-8 max-w-2xl space-y-3\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-3.5 text-left text-sm font-medium text-ink hover:bg-subtle\">How is the GEO score calculated?<span class=\"shrink-0 text-ink-3 transition-transform \"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\"><path d=\"M216.49,104.49l-80,80a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-80-80a12,12,0,0,1,17-17L128,159l71.51-71.52a12,12,0,0,1,17,17Z\"></path></svg></span></button><div class=\"grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out\" style=\"grid-template-rows:0fr\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"border-t border-line px-4 py-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-2\">Weighted dimensions — AI Visibility, Brand Prominence, Recommendation Performance, Competitive Position, Citation Visibility, Authority &amp; Trust, Technical GEO and Entity Consistency — each scored 0–100 and calibrated against a benchmark set. The exact set of dimensions comes from the audit backend.</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-3.5 text-left text-sm font-medium text-ink hover:bg-subtle\">Which AI models do you test?<span class=\"shrink-0 text-ink-3 transition-transform \"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\"><path d=\"M216.49,104.49l-80,80a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-80-80a12,12,0,0,1,17-17L128,159l71.51-71.52a12,12,0,0,1,17,17Z\"></path></svg></span></button><div class=\"grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out\" style=\"grid-template-rows:0fr\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"border-t border-line px-4 py-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-2\">ChatGPT (GPT-4o), Claude, Perplexity, Google AI Overviews / Gemini and Microsoft Copilot, depending on which providers the audit backend is configured to run. Each prompt is run multiple times per model and aggregated.</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-3.5 text-left text-sm font-medium text-ink hover:bg-subtle\">Do I need an account?<span class=\"shrink-0 text-ink-3 transition-transform \"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\"><path d=\"M216.49,104.49l-80,80a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-80-80a12,12,0,0,1,17-17L128,159l71.51-71.52a12,12,0,0,1,17,17Z\"></path></svg></span></button><div class=\"grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out\" style=\"grid-template-rows:0fr\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"border-t border-line px-4 py-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-2\">You can run a free audit and see your score without signing up. An account is used to save audits and track progress over time.</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-3.5 text-left text-sm font-medium text-ink hover:bg-subtle\">What is the difference between GEO and SEO?<span class=\"shrink-0 text-ink-3 transition-transform \"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\"><path d=\"M216.49,104.49l-80,80a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-80-80a12,12,0,0,1,17-17L128,159l71.51-71.52a12,12,0,0,1,17,17Z\"></path></svg></span></button><div class=\"grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out\" style=\"grid-template-rows:0fr\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"border-t border-line px-4 py-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-2\">SEO optimises for ranked links on a results page. GEO optimises for being cited, recommended and represented accurately inside an AI-generated answer, where there is often no list of links at all.</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-3.5 text-left text-sm font-medium text-ink hover:bg-subtle\">How long does an audit take?<span class=\"shrink-0 text-ink-3 transition-transform \"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\"><path d=\"M216.49,104.49l-80,80a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-80-80a12,12,0,0,1,17-17L128,159l71.51-71.52a12,12,0,0,1,17,17Z\"></path></svg></span></button><div class=\"grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out\" style=\"grid-template-rows:0fr\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"border-t border-line px-4 py-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-2\">Typically 1–4 minutes. The processing screen shows live status while the backend crawls your site and probes the configured AI engines.</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-3.5 text-left text-sm font-medium text-ink hover:bg-subtle\">Can I re-run an audit?<span class=\"shrink-0 text-ink-3 transition-transform \"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\"><path d=\"M216.49,104.49l-80,80a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-80-80a12,12,0,0,1,17-17L128,159l71.51-71.52a12,12,0,0,1,17,17Z\"></path></svg></span></button><div class=\"grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out\" style=\"grid-template-rows:0fr\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"border-t border-line px-4 py-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-2\">Yes. Re-running produces a fresh score against the current state of your site and the models.</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mx-auto mt-10 max-w-2xl rounded-xl border border-line bg-surface p-6 text-center\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-ink\">Not sure yet?</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-ink-2\">Run the free audit — you&#x27;ll see your score and top issues before deciding.</p><a class=\"btn-primary mx-auto mt-4\" href=\"/audit\">Run a free audit <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\"><path d=\"M224.49,136.49l-72,72a12,12,0,0,1-17-17L187,140H40a12,12,0,0,1,0-24H187L135.51,64.48a12,12,0,0,1,17-17l72,72A12,12,0,0,1,224.49,136.49Z\"></path></svg></a></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"border-t border-line bg-subtle/50\"><div class=\"site-container py-12\"><div class=\"grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[1.4fr_1fr_1fr_1fr]\"><div><a class=\"group inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 no-underline \" aria-label=\"phazeAi, home\" href=\"/\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative grid h-6 w-6 place-items-center border border-signal/50 text-signal\"><span class=\"absolute -left-px -top-px h-1.5 w-1.5 border-l border-t border-signal\"></span><span class=\"absolute -bottom-px -right-px h-1.5 w-1.5 border-b border-r border-signal\"></span><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M1 7.5 3.4 4l2.2 3.4L8 2.5 11 8\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.34em] text-ink-3\">phazeAi</span></a><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-xs text-sm text-ink-2\">See how visible your brand is in AI search — and get a dated plan to improve it.</p></div><div><p class=\"text-2xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-ink-3\">Product</p><ul class=\"mt-3 space-y-2\"><li><a cl