 pricing and the product\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto mt-8 max-w-2xl space-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L33\",\"How is the GEO score calculated?\",{\"summary\":\"How is the GEO score calculated?\",\"children\":\"Weighted dimensions — AI Visibility, Brand Prominence, Recommendation Performance, Competitive Position, Citation Visibility, Authority & Trust, Technical GEO and Entity Consistency — each scored 0–100 and calibrated against a benchmark set. The exact set of dimensions comes from the audit backend.\"}],[\"$\",\"$L33\",\"Which AI models do you test?\",{\"summary\":\"Which AI models do you test?\",\"children\":\"ChatGPT (GPT-4o), Claude, Perplexity, Google AI Overviews / Gemini and Microsoft Copilot, depending on which providers the audit backend is configured to run. Each prompt is run multiple times per model and aggregated.\"}],[\"$\",\"$L33\",\"Do I need an account?\",{\"summary\":\"Do I need an account?\",\"children\":\"You can run a free audit and see your score without signing up. An account is used to save audits and track progress over time.\"}],[\"$\",\"$L33\",\"What is the difference between GEO and SEO?\",{\"summary\":\"What is the difference between GEO and SEO?\",\"children\":\"SEO optimises for ranked links on a results page. GEO optimises for being cited, recommended and represented accurately inside an AI-generated answer, where there is often no list of links at all.\"}],[\"$\",\"$L33\",\"How long does an audit take?\",{\"summary\":\"How long does an audit take?\",\"children\":\"Typically 1–4 minutes. The processing screen shows live status while the backend crawls your site and probes the configured AI engines.\"}],[\"$\",\"$L33\",\"Can I re-run an audit?\",{\"summary\":\"Can I re-run an audit?\",\"children\":\"Yes. Re-running produces a fresh score against the current state of your site and the models.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto mt-10 max-w-2xl rounded-xl border border-line bg-surface p-6 text-c